      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_466-536",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "466-536",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "滚滚长江东逝水，浪花淘尽英雄。是非成败转头空：青山依旧在，几度夕阳红。白发渔樵江渚上，惯看秋月春风。一壶浊酒喜相逢：古今多少事，都付笑谈中。",
      "totalCount": 13860
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 449513849,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_2948-3176",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "2948-3176",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "那人不甚好读书，性宽和，寡言语，喜怒不形于色，素有大志，专好结交天下豪杰，生得身长七尺五寸，两耳垂肩，双手过膝，目能自顾其耳，面如冠玉，唇若涂脂，中山靖王刘胜之后，汉景帝阁下玄孙，姓刘名备，字玄德。",
      "totalCount": 5885
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 442359296,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_141_5485-5514",
      "chapterUid": 141,
      "range": "5485-5514",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "坚体中石、箭，脑浆迸流，人马皆死于岘山之内，寿止三十七岁。",
      "totalCount": 5504
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 924587797,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_137_6376-6427",
      "chapterUid": 137,
      "range": "6376-6427",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "卓怒曰：“天下事在我！我今为之，谁敢不从！汝视我之剑不利否？”袁绍亦拔剑曰：“汝剑利，吾剑未尝不利！”",
      "totalCount": 5320
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 27322657,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_146_1778-1839",
      "chapterUid": 146,
      "range": "1778-1839",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "吕布从后拍马赶来，将戟于操盔上一击，问曰：“曹操何在？”操反指曰：“前面骑黄马者是他。”吕布听说，弃了曹操，纵马向前追赶。",
      "totalCount": 4932
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 424421687,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_4965-5009",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "4965-5009",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不数日，人报黄巾贼将程远志统兵五万来犯涿郡。刘焉令邹靖引玄德等三人，统兵五百，前去破敌。",
      "totalCount": 4806
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 333982535,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_137_6116-6139",
      "chapterUid": 137,
      "range": "6116-6139",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "布纳卓坐而拜之曰：“公若不弃，布请拜为义父。”",
      "totalCount": 4734
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 361885497,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_153_931-1000",
      "chapterUid": 153,
      "range": "931-1000",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "当下刘安闻豫州牧至，欲寻野味供食，一时不能得，乃杀其妻以食之。玄德曰：“此何肉也？”安曰：“乃狼肉也。”玄德不疑，乃饱食了一顿，天晚就宿。",
      "totalCount": 4615
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 69377716,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_272_8970-9002",
      "chapterUid": 272,
      "range": "8970-9002",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "纷纷世事无穷尽，天数茫茫不可逃。鼎足三分已成梦，后人凭吊空牢骚。",
      "totalCount": 4420
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 226863294,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_164_6942-7020",
      "chapterUid": 164,
      "range": "6942-7020",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "于图书中检出书信一束，皆许都及军中诸人与绍暗通之书。左右曰：“可逐一点对姓名，收而杀之。”操曰：“当绍之强，孤亦不能自保，况他人乎？”遂命尽焚之，更不再问。",
      "totalCount": 4248
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 42975905,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_171_1852-1878",
      "chapterUid": 171,
      "range": "1852-1878",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "徽出门仰天大笑曰：“卧龙虽得其主，不得其时，惜哉！”",
      "totalCount": 3870
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 27929607,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_239_2096-2133",
      "chapterUid": 239,
      "range": "2096-2133",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "孔明不答。众将近前视之，已薨矣。时建兴十二年秋八月二十三日也，寿五十四岁。",
      "totalCount": 3706
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 378477596,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_4793-4827",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "4793-4827",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "二客大喜，愿将良马五十匹相送，又赠金银五百两，镔铁一千斤，以资器用。",
      "totalCount": 3598
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 917222179,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_152_4686-4743",
      "chapterUid": 152,
      "range": "4686-4743",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "惇大叫一声，急用手拔箭，不想连眼珠拔出，乃大呼曰：“父精母血，不可弃也！”遂纳于口内啖之，仍复挺枪纵马，直取曹性。",
      "totalCount": 3419
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 924587797,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_2075-2095",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "2075-2095",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "苍天已死，黄天当立；岁在甲子，天下大吉。",
      "totalCount": 3348
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 442359296,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_141_4115-4174",
      "chapterUid": 141,
      "range": "4115-4174",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "坚令诸军不可轻动，只伏于船中来往诱之，一连三日，船数十次傍岸。黄祖军只顾放箭，箭已放尽，坚却拔船上所得之箭，约十数万。",
      "totalCount": 3312
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 333982535,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_4099-4126",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "4099-4126",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "飞曰：“吾颇有资财，当招募乡勇，与公同举大事，如何？”",
      "totalCount": 3258
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 922085796,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_135_4191-4234",
      "chapterUid": 135,
      "range": "4191-4234",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "玄德看其人身长九尺，髯长二尺，面如重枣，唇若涂脂，丹凤眼，卧蚕眉，相貌堂堂，威风凛凛。",
      "totalCount": 3210
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 333982535,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_257_6832-6848",
      "chapterUid": 257,
      "range": "6832-6848",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "“三姓家奴休走！燕人张飞在此！”",
      "totalCount": 3184
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29855984",
      "userVid": 405649656,
      "bookmarkId": "29855984_149_1223-1240",
      "chapterUid": 149,
      "range": "1223-1240",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "屈身守分，以待天时，不可与命争也。",
      "totalCount": 3168
    }
  ],
